cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Antigravity IP Scanner"
abstract: >-
  Advanced Cloudflare IP optimization and censorship bypass tool.
  Discovers and verifies clean Cloudflare Edge IPs and WARP endpoints
  using real-world latency, jitter, and speed tests. Features DPI
  fragment analysis, SNI fronting, global analytics heatmap, and
  multi-language support (English, Persian, Russian).
